In this folder you will find an almost full database of 
various hindcast generated with the wave model WAVEWATCH III.

Using google-earth, you can visualize the different grids and the output points:
IOWAGA_WWATCH_MULTI_output_points.kmz

You can also access to the data using the opendap service to help you getting what you exactly need : 
http://tds1.ifremer.fr/thredds/IOWAGA-WW3-HINDCAST/IOWAGA-WW3-HINDCAST.html


***********
*ALTIMETER*
***********
area : Global grid
time : 1991 to 2014
info : ASCII and NETCDF formats with a file per sat
info : The satellite ids are : 1:ERS1 ; 2:ERS2 ; 3:ENVISAT ; 4:TOPEX ; 5:POSEIDON ; 6:JASON1 ; 7:GFO ; 8:JASON2; 9: CRYOSAT; 10: SARAL 


********
*ARCTIC*
********
area : Arctic grid
time : 2013 to 2015
spatial resolution : curvilinear grid
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - 3-hourly for spectral point
wind forcing : ECMWF
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : CFSR with homogeneous input IC1 and IC5
iceberg forcing : NO
info : still under development


*******
*BLACK*
*******
area : Black sea grid
time : 2004 to 2015 - data are missing for 2005 and 2012
spatial resolution : ?
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field
wind forcing : ECMWF
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NO
iceberg forcing : NO
info : some months are missing in 2011, 2014 and 2015


**********
*ATNE*
**********
area : North East Atlantic grid
time : 2007 to 2015 - data are missing from 2009-07 to 2012-01
spatial resolution : 10min
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - spectral point in ASCII 
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : NO



**********
*ATNW*
**********
area : North West Atlantic grid
time : 1990 to 2016 - data are missing from 1992-09 to 1992-12
spatial resolution : 10min
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field . See GLOBAL for spectral point output
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : NO


*********
*CRB*
*********
area : Carribean grid
time : 1990 to 2016 - data are missing from 2009-07 to 2012-01
spatial resolution : 2min
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - See GLOBAL for spectral point output
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : NO


************
*GLOBAL*
************
area : Global grid
time : 1990 to 2016 -
spatial resolution : 30min - 0.5deg
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - 3-hourly for spectral point
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : Yes for some years ... 
Parameterization: ST4 - TEST471 

********
*NC*
********
area : New Caledonia grid
time : 1990 to 2016 - 
spatial resolution : 3min
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - 
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : NO


**********
*PACE*
**********
area : West Pacific grid
time : 1990 to 2016 - data are missing from 2010-01 to 2012-01
spatial resolution : 10min
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - spectral point in ASCII
wind forcing : ECMWF or NCEP (CFSR) depending on the directory
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : NCEP
iceberg forcing : NO


**********
*NORGASUG*
**********
area : all along the French coast on the Atlantic ocean
time : 2008 to 2015
spatial resolution : unstructured mesh with resolution up to 300m along the coast
temporal resolution : hourly for gridded field and hourly spectral point
wind forcing : ECMWF
current forcing : harmonic
level forcing : harmonic
ice forcing : NO
iceberg forcing : NO


*******
*SISMO*
*******
area : global. These are specific model runs with different shoreline reflection, as used for seismic noise investigations
time : 1993 to 2015
spatial resolution : 30min - 0.5deg
temporal resolution : 3-hourly for gridded field - no spectral point
wind forcing : ECMWF
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : ?
iceberg forcing : ?


***********
*GLOBAL_IG*
***********
area : global grid for infragravity waves
time : 2012 to 2014
spatial resolution : 30min - 0.5deg
temporal resolution of outpu : 3-hourly for gridded field - no spectral point
wind forcing : ECMWF
current forcing : NO
level forcing : NO
ice forcing : CFSR
iceberg forcing : Yes 

